# Line endings are part of the build: include_str! embeds files byte for byte, so the Windows
# autocrlf conversion turned embedded lists into CRLF and some binary-looking fixtures into corrupt data.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ppm binary
*.pgm binary
*.pbm binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.img binary
*.wasm binary
*.webm binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.gz binary
*.pcap binary
*.fd binary
*.bin binary
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
